---
import StandardPageLayout from "../layouts/StandardPageLayout.astro";
const pageTitle = "About Me";
---
<StandardPageLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
    <div class="about-section">
        <p>
            I'm a <strong>game designer</strong> currently working on the <i>Call of Duty&reg;: Black Ops</i> series of video games as well as an indie stealth-action game.
            <br/><br/>
            I'm obsessed with discovering truth in design and focused on making the best entertainment in the world, which my multidisciplinary background in science and art has aided me in pursuing.
            <br/><br/>
            I currently reside in Los Angeles, California.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-section">
        <h2 class="title is-4">Skills</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Design Process, Documentation</li>
            <li>C/C++, C#, Python, HLSL/NVIDIA CG</li>
            <li>ML, DL, Computer Vision</li>
            <li>3D Math, Linear Algebra, Calculus</li>
            <li>Microcontrollers, Analog & Digital Circuits, Hardware</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="about-section">
    <h2 class="title is-4">Publication</h2>
        <p>
            Oliver, Jakob Arndt, Parwesh Rallapalli, Hodger Blume (2019). “Portable Implementations for High-End Hardware Platforms”,<br />
            Big Data Analytics in Cyber-Physical Systems: Machine Learning for the Internet of Things. Elsevier.
        <p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-section">
        <h2 class="title is-4">Education</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><i>M.S. Computer Science</i> from University of Southern California (May 2022)</li>
                <li><i>B.S.E. Computer Engineering</i> from Michigan State University (Dec 2019)</li>
            </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="about-section">
        <h2 class="title is-4">Certifications</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><i>Deep Learning for Computer Vision</i> from NVIDIA Deep Learning Institute (May 2019)</li>
            <li><i>Machine Learning</i> from Stanford University (Dec 2017)</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</StandardPageLayout>

<style is:global>
    body {
        background-color: rgb(186, 235, 186);
        color: black;
        text-emphasis-color: black;
    }

    .about-section {
        background-color: rgb(217, 255, 217);
        padding: 1.5rem;
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 6px 8px 0 rgba(0, 71, 32, 0.377);
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .about-section:hover {
        box-shadow: 8px 10px 0 rgba(0, 71, 32, 0.377);
        transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
    }

    .title {
        color: rgb(65, 65, 65) !important;
    }

    strong {
        color: black !important;
    }

    h3 {
        color: rgb(84, 77, 187) !important;
    }
</style>